WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,830 --> 00:00:01,750
It's her

2
00:00:01,750 --> 00:00:03,070
At that time in Xiangzhong University

3
00:00:03,070 --> 00:00:04,670
Yes, there were discussions in the dormitory all day long

4
00:00:04,670 --> 00:00:06,470
How can I catch up with this little iceberg flower?

5
00:00:06,470 --> 00:00:07,670
even bet

6
00:00:07,670 --> 00:00:08,950
Who can get her WeChat account?

7
00:00:08,950 --> 00:00:11,810
I didn't expect that I would come to work as a part-time social worker today.

8
00:00:11,810 --> 00:00:13,090
The property market is really miserable right now

9
00:00:13,090 --> 00:00:14,650
Not one house sold in two months

10
00:00:14,650 --> 00:00:17,090
Next month, even the basic salary will be deducted.

11
00:00:17,090 --> 00:00:18,770
The boss also fell ill and threw himself into the body.

12
00:00:18,770 --> 00:00:20,250
Spend a lot of money to hire a college flower girl

13
00:00:20,250 --> 00:00:21,410
Put up an image at the door

14
00:00:21,410 --> 00:00:23,490
All we attracted were paupers who took photos just to take advantage of the popularity.

15
00:00:23,490 --> 00:00:25,090
No one pays for a house

16
00:00:25,090 --> 00:00:26,490
Is there another guy who comes in and talks about free air conditioning?

17
00:00:26,490 --> 00:00:28,770
I just saw her boarding the ship at the Hong Kong Pavilion.

18
00:00:28,770 --> 00:00:30,370
Most probably I saw the smiling flower at the door.

19
00:00:30,370 --> 00:00:32,610
The golden bug came running in looking for the bathroom.

20
00:00:32,610 --> 00:00:35,090
Ignore her so as not to waste your time, two ladies?

21
00:00:35,090 --> 00:00:37,250
May I ask about the detached house in Linjia, Tianlan No.1?

22
00:00:37,250 --> 00:00:38,250
Are there county houses now?

23
00:00:38,250 --> 00:00:39,650
See for yourself on the sand table

24
00:00:39,650 --> 00:00:42,010
The cheapest single-family house here is more than 20 million yuan

25
00:00:42,010 --> 00:00:43,850
If you're not here to buy a house, don't ask around.

26
00:00:43,850 --> 00:00:45,930
If you break the sandbox model, you can't afford it.

27
00:00:45,930 --> 00:00:48,610
This is your sky-blue outfit's way of bringing guests, okay, okay?

28
00:00:48,610 --> 00:00:49,890
Stop pretending to be a gun

29
00:00:49,890 --> 00:00:51,930
Every day, poor students like you talk to each other about buying a house.

30
00:00:51,930 --> 00:00:53,410
We've seen too much, hurry up and get out
